object_v3: Version 4 of Object structure serialization is written only into MergeTree data parts and is not allowed in Native format. (INCORRECT_DATA)
dynamic_v3: Version 4 of Dynamic structure serialization is written only into MergeTree data parts and is not allowed in Native format. (INCORRECT_DATA)
dynamic_duplicate_types: Duplicate type Int64 in the list of types of a flattened Dynamic column. (INCORRECT_DATA)
dynamic_nothing_type: Type Nothing is not allowed in the list of types of a flattened Dynamic column. (INCORRECT_DATA)
object_duplicate_flattened_path: Duplicate path x in the list of paths of a flattened Object column. (INCORRECT_DATA)
object_duplicate_dynamic_path: Duplicate path in the list of dynamic paths of an Object column. (INCORRECT_DATA)
object_typed_path_collision_flattened: Path x of an Object column is stored as a dynamic path, but it is a typed path in the type of the column. (INCORRECT_DATA)
object_typed_path_collision: Path x of an Object column is stored as a dynamic path, but it is a typed path in the type of the column. (INCORRECT_DATA)
object_duplicate_path_after_realloc: Duplicate path p0 in the list of paths of a flattened Object column. (INCORRECT_DATA)
